OL,3,GNEWSASir Tom Jones announces homecoming
OL,4,Agigs after cancelling shows due to flu
OL,5,
OL,6,FSir Tom Jones has announced two
OL,7,Fheadline shows in Wales just weeks
OL,8,Fafter he was forced to cancel or
OL,9,Freschedule a number of tour dates due
OL,10,Fto illness.
OL,12,FThe 86-year-old Welsh music icon's
OL,13,Fhomecoming, as part of his Come Gather
OL,14,FRound world tour, will see him perform
OL,15,Fat Cardiff Castle on 30 May, followed
OL,16,Fby a fully-seated show at Llangollen
OL,17,FPavilion in Denbighshire on 28 June.
OL,19,FHeather Small will feature as a special
OL,20,Fguest at the Cardiff show, while soul
OL,21,Fband Stone Foundation will also join
OL,22,Fthe bill at both concerts.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
